  "historyNote": "#5332, eff 4-1-92 (from Den 304.02); amd by #6186, eff 2-17-96; paragraphs (a)-(c), (g) & (h) EXPIRED: 4-1-98; ss by #6909, eff 12-9-98; amd by #7364, eff 9-19-00; amd by #8694, eff 7-27-06; ss by #8838, eff 3-9-07; amd by #10328-B, eff 5-7-13; ss by #10689, eff 10-7-14; ss by #10991, eff 12-9-15; ss by #12428, eff 12-6-17; ss by #13021, eff 4-9-20; ss by #14398, eff 12-2-25, EXPIRES: 12-2-35 (formerly Den 403.03)",
